  "title": "Nabis to Acquire Hudson Distribution Services’ New Jersey Cannabis Distribution License",
  "summary": "Nabis has partnered with Hudson Distribution Services to acquire its New Jersey cannabis distribution license and warehouse lease, expanding Nabis' wholesale technology platform to the tri-state area. New Jersey brands and retailers can expect access to Nabis Marketplace, including real-time inventory, automated payments, and financing tools, in the second half of 2026.",
